# Where the FastAPI/Socket.IO backend is reachable from the browser.
#
# Local dev (LAN): leave UNSET — frontend auto-derives the backend URL from
# the browser's hostname (so QR-scanned phones reach the host's LAN IP, and
# `localhost` access keeps working too).
#
# Tunnel mode (`./run.sh --tunnel`): this file is overwritten with the
# backend's ngrok URL each run, e.g.:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://trivia-be.ngrok-free.app
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* vars are read at compile time by Next.js, so changing this
# requires a rebuild for `next start` mode (dev mode picks it up on next
# request).
